nodes.specifics:
Op { tenant: TenantId /* from verified session only; no constructor from request bytes */, cap: CapId /* build-time registered */, budget: Budget{max_rows<=10_000, max_bytes<=8MiB, deadline_ms<=5000}, kind: OpKind }
OpKind = Get{coll: CollId, key: KeyTuple} | Query{coll, pred: Pred, proj: Vec<FieldId>, order: Vec<(FieldId,Dir)>, limit<=budget.max_rows, cursor: Option<Opaque>} | Put{coll, key, doc: TypedDoc, cond: Option<Pred>} | Delete{coll, key, cond} | Append{stream: StreamId, msg: Bytes<=1MiB} | Subscribe{stream, from: Offset} | BlobGet{obj: ObjId} | BlobPut{max_len, content_type: Mime} | Presign{method: Get|Put, obj: ObjId, ttl_s<=900} | Call{svc: SvcId, method: MethodId, body: TypedMsg} | VectorSearch{coll, vec: [f32;N], k<=100, pred} | Named{stmt: StmtId, params: Vec<Scalar>}
Pred = And(Vec<Pred>) | Or(Vec<Pred>) | Not(Box<Pred>) | Cmp{field: FieldId, op: Eq|Ne|Lt|Le|Gt|Ge|In|Prefix, val: Scalar}   // FieldId/CollId/StreamId/ObjId are enums generated from schema; Scalar = typed values only, never names/operators/strings that start with '$'
Tenant binding (lowering, per family): RLS families (CRDB, YSQL, SQL Server) -> session var / SESSION_CONTEXT(@read_only=1) + native policy; PEP families (MySQL, TiDB, Mongo, Cassandra/Scylla, Neo4j, Qdrant, OpenSearch, Meili, Influx) -> mandatory conjunct tenant_field = $tenant prepended to pred; namespace families (Redis, FDB, S3, Kafka, NATS) -> adapter-constructed prefix t/<tenant>/ (ObjId/KeyTuple are opaque suffixes, raw keys rejected; reject '..', '%2F', NUL); DynamoDB -> PK = tenant + per-tenant STS session tag LeadingKeys.
WIT: package aegis:data@0.1.0; interface ops { variant op-kind {...}; record op { tenant: tenant-handle /* resource minted by host */, cap: u32, budget: budget, kind: op-kind }; execute: func(o: op) -> result<rows, data-error>; }  tenant-handle is a host-owned WIT resource so a guest adapter cannot forge another tenant.
